          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On Sunday, July 10, 2011, between 12:30 AM and 12:45 AM, several people observed a dozen orange glowing points forming a significant group in the sky. The main witness, with excellent reflexes, filmed the observation with his camera while calling the gendarmerie. On Friday, July 15, 2011, at 11:22 PM, the witness made another observation of a similar phenomenon. The video of the first observation, provided by the witness to the gendarmerie, is typical of an observation of the passage of Thai lanterns. The GEIPAN (French UFO investigation group) highlights the exemplary investigation conducted by the gendarmerie, which concludes that it was the passage of Thai lanterns. Although formal proof is not provided, the witness supports the conclusion, and the GEIPAN fully endorses it.",
